# MovieList Design System

## When to apply

Apply these rules when you are about to:

- Create or modify a React component under `src/components/**` or `src/app/**`.
- Write Tailwind classes that use colors (`bg-*`, `text-*`, `border-*`, `ring-*`, `divide-*`, `from-*`, `to-*`, `via-*`, `placeholder-*`, `caret-*`, `outline-*`, `shadow-*` with color).
- Edit `globals.css` or `tailwind.config.ts`.

If the change does not involve color (logic, layout, animations, fetch), you can ignore this rule.

## Core principle

**Never use Tailwind default colors directly** (`blue-500`, `yellow-500`, `red-500`, `neutral-100`, `gray-200`, `white` without dark context, `zinc-800`, `slate-*`, etc.). Always replace them with the **design system tokens** defined in `src/app/globals.css` and registered in `tailwind.config.ts`.

## Available tokens

Defined in `src/app/globals.css` (`:root`) and consumed via `tailwind.config.ts`:

| Category  | Token                | Typical use                                          |
| --------- | -------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| Background | `background`         | Root background (changes with `prefers-color-scheme`). |
| Background | `background-primary` | Main shell background (near-black).                  |
| Background | `background-secondary` | Secondary panels.                                   |
| Background | `background-elevated` | Header / cards / elevated widgets.                  |
| Surface    | `surface-primary`    | Input, chip, toggle backgrounds.                     |
| Surface    | `surface-hover`      | Hover state for interactive surfaces.                |
| Surface    | `surface-active`     | Pressed / active state.                              |
| Border     | `border-subtle`      | 1-2px borders on dark backgrounds.                   |
| Border     | `border-strong`      | Higher contrast borders (focus visible, etc.).       |
| Accent     | `accent-primary`     | Brand color, CTAs, indicators, focus.                |
| Accent     | `accent-hover`       | Hover/active for accent (slightly lighter).          |
| Accent     | `accent-muted`       | Disabled states / muted variants.                    |
| Text       | `text-primary`       | Primary text on dark backgrounds.                    |
| Text       | `text-secondary`     | Secondary text, labels.                              |
| Text       | `text-muted`         | Disabled or decorative text.                         |
| Danger     | `danger`             | Errors, destructive actions (delete, cancel).        |
| Danger     | `danger-hover`       | Hover for danger.                                    |

## Replacement table (light + dark)

When you see a default Tailwind class, map it like this:

### Action accents (hardcoded blue ↔ yellow)

| Before (❌)                                                | After (✅)                                                                 |
| --------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `bg-blue-500`                                             | `bg-accent-primary`                                                        |
| `bg-blue-600` / `hover:bg-blue-600`                       | `bg-accent-hover` / `hover:bg-accent-hover`                                |
| `text-blue-500`                                           | `text-accent-primary`                                                      |
| `hover:text-blue-500`                                     | `hover:text-accent-primary`                                                |
| `text-blue-700`                                           | `text-accent-muted`                                                        |
| `bg-blue-500 dark:bg-yellow-500`                          | `bg-accent-primary dark:bg-accent-primary` (one token covers both)         |
| `text-blue-500 dark:text-yellow-500`                      | `text-accent-primary dark:text-accent-primary`                             |
| `hover:text-blue-700 dark:hover:text-orange-700`          | `hover:text-accent-muted dark:hover:text-accent-muted`                     |
| `focus:ring-blue-500`                                     | `focus:ring-accent-primary`                                                |
| `border-yellow-500 bg-yellow-500`                         | `border-accent-primary bg-accent-primary`                                  |

