| Before (❌)                                  | After (✅)                                   |
| ------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |
| `bg-red-500`                                | `bg-danger`                                  |
| `bg-red-600` / `hover:bg-red-600`           | `bg-danger-hover` / `hover:bg-danger-hover`  |
